      <title>Boris, the friendly Bokoblin</title>
      <author>Deano309</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/723383</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/723383#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">5978c52cfcd6f3abd98662d61e8b1f8aff0a68af</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 05:42:53 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac0780ee457a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac337bf27ca3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac0780e9f794.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Update&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature&lt;/em&gt;: If player is wearing the Champion's Leathers, Boris becomes a more powerful armored Warrior (Who doesn't randomly chase after wildlife!)&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Added spawn effect&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Optimization&lt;/em&gt;: Optimised files&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Boris, the friendly Bokoblin.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Boris is a young Bokoblin who has dreams of becoming more than his brethren.&lt;br&gt;As he was growing up, he heard stories of a Legendary Hylian warrior, who was the sworn enemy of his people.&lt;br&gt;But, despite all others of his kind fearing or hating this warrior, Boris was filled with awe.&lt;br&gt;He thought of the warrior as a hero, so left his people in search of becoming the Warrior's student.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will find him waiting around outside Lookout Landing, hoping to be recruited.&lt;br&gt;Once recruited, he can be summoned to your side by &lt;b&gt;whistling&lt;/b&gt; (And dismissed using button combo "&lt;b&gt;ZL+A&lt;/b&gt;").&lt;br&gt;When you require assistance, he will provide what help he can...&lt;br&gt;Although small, his bravery cannot be faulted as he will charge into battle without any consideration as to what he is facing.&lt;br&gt;As a young student, he lacks discipline and focus (Sometimes he is busy daydreaming until an enemy wanders straight in front of him, and he also often runs off to chase wildlife!).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;HOWEVER&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, if you are wearing the Champion's Leathers, he becomes an inspired and focused ally. With armor plating and improved sword &amp;amp; shield, he can make a real difference in battle.&lt;br&gt;He won't follow your path when you leave, instead he will remain watchful in the area you last summoned him.&lt;br&gt;He has a lot to learn and, maybe one day, if he is lucky enough, he can fulfil his dream of becoming as strong as a real Sage!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;This modifies the Player brain and is not compatible with any other mod that also edits this.&lt;br&gt;Boris is not permitted to follow you whilst you're inside Shrines.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;TKMM required for installing and only tested on TotK v1.2.1&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
