    <item>
      <title>The One Ring</title>
      <author>Deano309</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/644763</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/644763#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">c0dd4429d4c26bce0e69573bb89fed2a23297066</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 00:41:29 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abdabb80fc0d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/695e3249de58d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/695e324a10309.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/695e3249d66c8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/695e3249f1ffd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/695e3249da203.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/695e324a02d86.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Phantom Ganondorf Spawn Version&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Suggestion&lt;/em&gt;: Added another version which causes Phantom Ganondorf to spawn after a period of wearing the ring.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i class="SelectedElement"&gt;This was another item that was done for a request, but I have decided to add it here too!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;v1.0.3 Now modifies the Player brain and is not compatible with any other mod that also modifies it.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What is this?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is The One Ring!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This takes up a aingle Armor slot in your inventory.&lt;br&gt;Armor Defence: &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;70&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;i&gt;Not upgradable&lt;/i&gt;).&lt;br&gt;Cost: 1000 Rupees from Beedle at Dueling Peaks Stable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Armor has a transparent effect.&lt;br&gt;Player is now undetectable to enemies, wildlife, Zonai terminal sensors etc. as long as it is being worn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Armor also has additional buffs, including:&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;L3 Stealth, Speed &amp;amp; Resistance to Elemental damage sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phantom Ganondorf Spawn Version:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;After wearing the ring for 20-30 minutes (&lt;i&gt;Random&lt;/i&gt;), your ring will betray you and Phantom Ganondorf will sense it &amp;amp; spawn in.&lt;br&gt;You will be visible to everything again until the ring is restored.&lt;br&gt;Your only options to restore it are to defeat Ganondorf, or to keep running away and hiding until your ring's power is automatically restored after 5 minutes of wearing it.&lt;br&gt;Ganondorf is relentless and will find you almost anywhere (&lt;i&gt;If you teleport away, he WILL follow you!&lt;/i&gt;), but he can't see you if you're either not wearing the ring, or are protected by the light inside a shrine (You also can't restore the ring if you're not wearing it or whilst you're inside a shrine though).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ONLY&lt;/b&gt; after defeating Ganondorf, or a &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;TOTAL of 5 minutes&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; of wearing the ring has passed (&lt;i&gt;Outside of shrines&lt;/i&gt;), will the ring be restored and you will once again be undetectable (Until the next random spawn).&lt;br&gt;You will emit a visual effect as the ring is restoring.&lt;br&gt;Removing the ring does not reset or adjust any timers, as it only counts whilst you are wearing it (So if you choose to remove the ring after Ganondorf has already spawned in, when you reequip it, he will reappear straight away!).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;TKMM Required for installing &amp;amp; only tested on TotK 1.2.1.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/one_ring_armor_103.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/one_ring_armor_-_phantom_spawn_103.zip" type="application/zip"/>
