      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abdf37419e66.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abdf14755e9f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Description&lt;/h2&gt;This mod lets you use the bow, sword and shield while on a control stick, allowing you to shoot arrows, attack with weapons and defend with your shield while using your zonai vehicles. Even better - you can control your vehicle at the same time!&#13;
&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requires Tears of the Kingdom &lt;b&gt;1.2.1&lt;/b&gt;. Other versions ignore the files and play normally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Emulator:&lt;/b&gt; copy the &lt;code&gt;drive-by&lt;/code&gt;&amp;nbsp;folder into the game's mod folder (&lt;code&gt;load/0100F2C0115B6000/&lt;/code&gt;) and enable &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;drive-by&lt;/span&gt; in the Add-Ons list.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Switch:&lt;/b&gt; Copy the archive's `atmosphere` folder to the root of the SD card, so you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;atmosphere/exefs_patches/drive-by/9B4E43650501A4D4489B4BBFDB740F26AF3CF850.ips&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Drive-by uses no executable module slot, so it loads beside exlaunch mods. It conflicts only with patches or cheats that change the same places in the game; &lt;a href="// https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/free-rein"&gt;README.md&lt;/a&gt; lists them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tested on 1.2.1 in Eden (with the patch, and separately with only the cheat file) and on a Switch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Drive-by's patch and cheat text are MIT licensed, copyright HanSoloBlaster.&lt;br&gt;Source: &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/free-rein" target="_blank"&gt;https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/free-rein&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
